{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"∞-2-意象"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"(∞,2)-意象"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>参考 "},{"Local":{"url":"AbellanMartiniInf2Topoi","text":"Abellan–Martini"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>$(\\infty,2)$-意象是 $(\\infty,1)$-意象在更高范畴层级的类比: 正如 $(\\infty,1)$-意象提供了"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"综合数学","text":"综合"}},{"Plain":"语言 ("},{"Local":{"url":"同伦类型论","text":"同伦类型论"}},{"Plain":"), $(\\infty,2)$-意象提供 "},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"$(\\infty ,1)$-范畴"}},{"Plain":"的综合语言.</p>\n<p>正如 $(\\infty,1)$-意象是满足某类"},{"Local":{"url":"下降","text":"下降"}},{"Plain":"条件的"},{"Local":{"url":"可表现范畴","text":"可表现 $(\\infty,1)$-范畴"}},{"Plain":", $(\\infty,2)$-意象是某种特殊的"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶可表现范畴","text":"可表现 $(\\infty,2)$-范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}